# --- Claude Code dev container ---

# Personal working copies (bind-mounted / baked into the container). Each dev
# keeps their own; the committed *.example files are the shared baseline.
/CLAUDE.md
/claude.json
# Baked git identity + credential helpers. Holds your name, email and the read-write
# tree path; copy from gitconfig.example.
/gitconfig

# Kept TRACKED (no secrets in any):
#   CLAUDE.md.example    -> agent-memory baseline; copy to CLAUDE.md on first setup
#   claude.json.example  -> MCP config-as-code; PATs injected at runtime, rest use OAuth
#   gitconfig.example    -> git identity/credential baseline; copy to gitconfig
#   gitconfig-ds         -> read-write credential override; generic (token from env)
# (Noted here only as a reminder; they are intentionally NOT ignored.)

# Environment file: holds GH_TOKEN_RW, GH_TOKEN_RO, GH_RW_TREE, PROJECTS_DIR, etc.
/.env

# Machine-specific compose override (per-project node_modules volumes, etc.).
# Commit docker-compose.override.yml.example instead.
/docker-compose.override.yml